1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,033
I'm sorry.

2
00:00:03,167 --> 00:00:04,367
Forgive me...

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,667
for leaving.

4
00:00:06,667 --> 00:00:09,567
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

5
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:10,667
[SOBS]

6
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:12,133
Why did you leave?

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,367
I was a coward.

8
00:00:18,367 --> 00:00:21,700
When my parents discovered
our relationship,

9
00:00:23,333 --> 00:00:25,000
they were furious.

10
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:28,367
They looked down on her.

11
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,700
They threatened me

12
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:36,400
and said something
terrible would happen

13
00:00:36,433 --> 00:00:40,567
if I didn't leave her.

14
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,133
[SNIFFLES]

15
00:00:47,433 --> 00:00:49,200
You know,

16
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,733
my mother...

17
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,433
she raised me all by herself.

18
00:00:58,433 --> 00:01:01,333
Even when she's getting
more sick each day,

19
00:01:01,333 --> 00:01:03,767
she never asked
anybody for help.

20
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,400
Because for her,

21
00:01:09,833 --> 00:01:11,400
I was enough.

22
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:18,200
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

23
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,400
This time,

24
00:01:20,667 --> 00:01:22,700
let me fight for you.

25
00:01:24,533 --> 00:01:26,033
I will do anything.

26
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:30,167
If you want
to save this hotel...

27
00:01:32,433 --> 00:01:34,133
so be it.

28
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,400
Just give me...

29
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,067
another chance.

30
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:47,767
[MUSIC BECOMES GENTLE]

31
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:15,800
[GENTLE MUSIC CONTINUES]

32
00:02:18,533 --> 00:02:20,233
[MOUTHING]
<i> (In Filipino) I love you.</i>

33
00:02:21,567 --> 00:02:28,500
[MUSIC BECOMES ROMANTIC]
